# Stop & Stay: stay text format

When writing or updating `place_content.stay_de` / `stay_en` (or suggesting SQL/CSV for them):

## Required format

One section per line (or newline-separated sections), always with a colon after the label:

```
Beste Option: Campsite Name (optional note) – price, facilities, distance
Alternative: Other Campsite – details
Freistehen: not permitted – short reason
```

English:

```
Best option: Campsite Name (optional note) – price, facilities, distance
Alternative: Other Campsite – details
Freestanding: not permitted – short reason
```

## Forbidden (breaks StopStayCard parsing)

Do **not** put the label alone on one line and the name/details on following lines:

```
Beste Option (außerhalb der Festivalwoche)
Wohnmobilstellplatz Landgasthof Wacken, Gasthaus vor Ort
4 Plätze, kein Strom
```

## Labels the UI understands

- `Beste Option` / `Best option`
- `Alternative` / `Alternativ`
- `Freistehen` / `Freestanding` / `Wildcampen` / `Wild camping` / `Free camping` (and close variants)

## Links

- `camping_link_1` → Beste Option campsite (official site, or `null` for Google Maps fallback)
- `camping_link_2` → Alternative campsite
- Never `alpacacamping.de` / `.com` (see no-alpacacamping-links rule)
